  "verseCount": 31,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "3",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "JDG 3"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "3",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 3:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lezi yilezozizwe iNkosi eyazitshiya ukuba ihlole uIsrayeli ngazo labo ababengazilwanga izimpi zaseKanani, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "yayiqonde ukufundisa izizukulwana zabakoIsrayeli ezizayo, ikakhulu labo abangafundanga ukulwa esikhathini esingaphambili, ukulwa impi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yilezike izizwe; amakhosi amahlanu amaFilistiya, lawo wonke amaKanani, lamaSidoni, lamaHivi ayehlala entabeni zaseLebanoni, kusukela entabeni yaseBali‐Hermoni kuze kufike ngasekungeneni kweHamathi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.3.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Zazingezokuhlola uIsrayeli ukuze kwaziwe ukuba uIsrayeli uzayilalela yini imilayo yeNkosi eyabalaya yona oyise ngoMose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.3.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AbakoIsrayeli bahlala phakathi kwamaKanani lamaHethi lamaAmori lamaPerizi lamaHivi lamaJebusi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.3.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 3:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "bathatha amadodakazi azo aba ngomkabo, amadodakazi abo bawendisela amadodana abo, bakhonza onkulunkulu bazo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.3.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 3:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.3.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 3:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AbakoIsrayeli benza okubi phambi kweNkosi, bayikhohlwa iNkosi uNkulunkulu wabo, bakhonza oBali ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.3.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ". ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.3.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 3:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngakho ulaka lweNkosi lwavutha kuIsrayeli, yabanikela esandleni sikaKushani‐Rishathayimi inkosi yaseAramu eliphakathi kwemifula emibili; abakoIsrayeli bayisebenzela inkosi uKushani‐Rishathayimi iminyaka eficaminwembili. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.3.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kodwa kwathi lapho abakoIsrayeli bekhala eNkosini, iNkosi yabalethela umkhululi owabakhululayo, uOthiniyeli indodana kaKenazi umnawakhe kaKalebi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.3.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 3:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Umoya weNkosi wehlela kuye, waba ngumahluleli koIsrayeli, waphuma impi, iNkosi yanikela esandleni sakhe uKushani‐Rishathayimi inkosi yaseAramu, wamnqoba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.3.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 3:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwaba khona ukuthula elizweni iminyaka engamatshumi amane. UOthiniyeli indodana kaKenazi wasesifa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.3.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 3:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.3.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 3:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AbakoIsrayeli babuya benza okubi phambi kweNkosi. INkosi yasimnika amandla uEgiloni inkosi yaseMowabi ukulwa loIsrayeli, ngoba babenzile okubi phambi kwayo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.3.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.3.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 3:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wahlangana lamaAmoni lamaAmaleki, bamahlula uIsrayeli, bawuthumba umuzi waMalala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.3.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.3.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 3:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AbakoIsrayeli babengaphansi kukaEgiloni inkosi yaseMowabi iminyaka elitshumi leficaminwembili. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.3.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.3.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 3:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kodwa kwathi lapho abakoIsrayeli bekhala eNkosini, iNkosi yabalethela umkhululi, uEhudi indodana kaGera, owakoBenjamini owayelinxele. AbakoIsrayeli bathumela umthelo wabo kuEgiloni inkosi yaseMowabi ngaye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.3.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.3.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 3:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UEhudi wazenzela umhedla obukhali inxa zombili, ubude bawo buyingalonye, wawuhloma ngaphansi kwezigqoko zakhe ngasethangazini langasokunene. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.3.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.3.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 3:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wamnika uEgiloni inkosi yaseMowabi lowomthelo. UEgiloni wayengumuntu oqatha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.3.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.3.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 3:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UEhudi eseqedile ukumnika umthelo, waseyekela abantu ababethwele umthelo ukuba bahambe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.3.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.3.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 3:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kodwa yena wabuyela emuva ngasematsheni abaziweyo phansi kweGiligali, wathi: Nkosi, ngilendaba eyimfihlo kuwe. UEgiloni wasebathulisa, wabakhupha bonke ababelaye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.3.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.3.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 3:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UEhudi wasondela kuye ehlezi yedwa endlini yakhe epholileyo esophahleni. UEhudi wathi kuye: Ngilendaba evela kuNkulunkulu kuwe. UEgiloni wasesukuma esihlalweni sakhe; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.3.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.3.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 3:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "uEhudi waseselula isandla sakhe sekhohlo, wahwatshwa umhedla ngasethangazini lakhe langasokunene, wamhlaba ngawo esiswini, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.3.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.3.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 3:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kwaze kwatshona lesilanda, amahwahwa awugubuzela umhedla, kawuncothulanga esiswini sakhe, kwaphuma lomswane. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.3.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.3.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 3:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UEhudi wasephumela phandle, wavala iminyango yendlu esophahleni, wayikhiya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.3.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.3.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 3:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Esehambile, kwafika izinceku; kwathi lapho zibona iminyango yendlu esophahleni ikhiyiwe, zathi mhlawumbe uye ngaphandle endlini epholileyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.3.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.3.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 3:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Zalinda zaze zaphelelwa yikwazi; kodwa lapho elokhu engayivuli iminyango yendlu esophahleni, zathatha ikhiye zayivula, zabona inkosi yazo ilele phansi isifile. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.3.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.3.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 3:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UEhudi wabaleka zisalibele, wedlula ematsheni ebaziweyo, waya eSeyira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.3.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.3.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 3:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwathi esefikile wakhalisa uphondo ezintabeni zakoEfrayimi. AbakoIsrayeli behla laye ezintabeni ebahola. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.3.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.3.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 3:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wathi kibo: Ngilandelani, ngoba iNkosi inikele izitha zenu amaMowabi ezandleni zenu. Ngakhoke bamlandela, bawavalela amaMowabi ukuba angachaphi ngamazibuko eJordani, kabavumelanga muntu ukuchapha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.3.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.3.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 3:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Babulala ngalesosikhathi amaMowabi angaba zinkulungwane ezilitshumi, amadoda empi aqinileyo lalamandla, kakuphunyukanga muntu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.3.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.3.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 3:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AmaMowabi anqotshwa mhlalokho ngabakoIsrayeli. Kwaba khona ukuthula elizweni iminyaka engamatshumi eficaminwembili.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.3.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.3.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
